      "question": "Find the value of \\(\\frac{{{{\\tan }^2}60^\\circ + {{\\cot }^2}30^\\circ }}{{{{\\tan }^2}20^\\circ - {{\\sec }^2}20^\\circ }} - \\frac{{\\sin 90^\\circ + \\cos 0^\\circ }}{{\\cos e{c^2}20^\\circ - {{\\cot }^2}20^\\circ }}\\) .",
      "questionHtml": "Find the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{{{\\tan }^2}60^\\circ + {{\\cot }^2}30^\\circ }}{{{{\\tan }^2}20^\\circ - {{\\sec }^2}20^\\circ }} - \\frac{{\\sin 90^\\circ + \\cos 0^\\circ }}{{\\cos e{c^2}20^\\circ - {{\\cot }^2}20^\\circ }}\\)</span>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-8",
