    },
    {
      "id": "bf1f554b3858-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "A = sin&theta; + tan&theta; and B = sin&theta; - tan&theta;, If (&radic;3 - 2) &times; A = (&radic;3 + 2) &times; B, then find the value of cos(2&theta;).",
      "questionHtml": "A = sin&theta; + tan&theta; and B<span style=\"\">&nbsp;= sin&theta; - tan&theta;, If (&radic;3 - 2) &times; A =&nbsp;(&radic;3 + 2)&nbsp;&times; B, then find the value of cos(2&theta;).</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "0.500",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">0.500</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0.577",
          "html": "0.577"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "0.866",
          "html": "0.866"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0.750",
          "html": "0.750"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">A = sin&theta; + tan&theta; and B</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= sin&theta; - tan&theta;,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(&radic;3 - 2) &times; A =&nbsp;(&radic;3 + 2)&nbsp;&times; B</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">According to the question,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;(&radic;3 - 2) &times; A =&nbsp;(&radic;3 + 2)&nbsp;&times; B</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">It can be written as:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3 - 2}{√3 + 2}\\)</span> =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{B}{A}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Again according to the question,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3 - 2}{√3 + 2}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\text {sin} θ - \\text {tan} θ}{\\text {sin} θ + \\text {tan} θ}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Apply componendo and dividendo.</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3 - 2 + √3 + 2}{√3 - 2 - √3 - 2}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\text {sin} θ - \\text {tan} θ + \\text {sin} θ + \\text {tan} θ}{ \\text {sin} θ - \\text {tan} θ - \\text {sin} θ - \\text {tan} θ}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2√3}{ - 4}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2\\text {sin} θ}{ -2\\text {tan} θ}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3}{ 2}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\text {sin} θ}{ \\text {tan} θ}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;cos&theta; =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3}{ 2}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Since cos(30<sup>∘</sup>) =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{√3}{ 2}\\)</span>,</p>\n\n<p>Therefore,&nbsp;&theta; = 30<sup>∘</sup></p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = cos<span style=\"\">(2&theta;)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; ? = cos(2 &times; <span style=\"\">30</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">∘</span>)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = cos(60<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">∘</span>) = 0.5</p>\n\n<p><strong>Therefore, &#39;0.5&#39; is the required answer.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bf1f554b3858-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "What is (sin 2 x - cos 2 x) (1 - sin 2 x cos 2 x) equal to?",
      "questionHtml": "What is (sin<sup>2</sup> x - cos<sup>2</sup> x) (1 - sin<sup>2</sup> x cos<sup>2</sup> x) equal to?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "sin 4 x - cos 4 x",
          "html": "sin<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "sin 6 x - cos 6 x",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">6</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x - cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">6</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "cos 8 x - sin 8 x",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">8</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x - sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">8</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "sin 8 x - cos 8 x",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">8</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x - cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">8</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Expression is (sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)(1 - sin<sup>2</sup> x cos<sup>2</sup> x)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x + cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x = 1</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">(a + b)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= (a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ 2ab)</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= (a - b)(a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ ab</span><span style=\"\">)</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b>Calculation:</b></p>\n\n<p>We have</p>\n\n<p>(sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)(1 - sin<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>x cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)[(sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x + cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x]&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Applying the formua&nbsp;(2)&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)[(sin<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x + cos<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x + 2sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x) - sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x]&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)(sin<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x + cos<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;x + sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)</p>\n\n<p>We know&nbsp; that, a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= (a - b)(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+&nbsp;b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ ab)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sin<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- (cos<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;x)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; sin<sup>6</sup>&nbsp;x - cos<sup>6</sup>&nbsp;x</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;The value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">(sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x - cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x) (1 - sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x) is equal to&nbsp;sin</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">6</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x - cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">6</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;x.</span></strong></p>\n",
