    {
      "id": "bf1f554b3858-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If Cosec &theta; + Cot &theta; = m, find the value of \\(\\rm\\frac{m^{2}−1}{m^{2}+1}\\) .",
      "questionHtml": "If Cosec &theta; + Cot &theta; = m, find the value of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{m^{2}−1}{m^{2}+1}\\)</span>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Cos &theta;",
          "html": "Cos &theta;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "&minus;Sin &theta;",
          "html": "&minus;Sin &theta;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \">cosec θ + cot θ = m      ---- (1)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \">⇒ (cosec θ - cot θ)(cosec θ + cot θ) = 1 ⇒ (cosec θ - cot θ) =1/m      ---- (2)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \">2cosecθ = m + 1/m <span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">⇒ cosecθ = (m<sup>2</sup> + 1)/2m  ...(3)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">cotθ = (m</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\"> - 1)/2m   ...(4)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{m^{2}−1}{m^{2}+1}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \">Putting eq. (3) and (4) in above expression:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">⇒ 2mcotθ/2mcosecθ  ⇒ cotθ/</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">cosecθ ⇒ cosθ</span></p>\n",
