      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">sin θ + 1/sin θ = √5</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);  \">x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3 </span>+ 1/x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> = (x + 1/x)<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> - 3(x + 1/x) ⇒ <span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">sin</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51); line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\"> θ + 1/sin</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51); line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\"> θ </span> = (<span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">√5</span>)<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> - 3(<span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">√5</span>) ⇒ 5<span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">√5</span> - 3<span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">√5</span> = 2<span style=\"color: rgb(30, 43, 51);\">√5</span></p>\n",
